    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to DreamWorld, a groundbreaking Sandbox MMO, where all players create together in a single infinite world. Adventure through our biomes, collect rare resources, craft the best gear, and take down epic world bosses with friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE UNBELIEVABLE STRUCTURES</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy and paste building pieces. Create from any resource you collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/9cf54b7f23e6d8acdbd58a5b44f91312.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/9cf54b7f23e6d8acdbd58a5b44f91312.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/9cf54b7f23e6d8acdbd58a5b44f91312.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT TO SURVIVE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an array of weapons and spells to fight world bosses and mobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/7105b31e230e6018f386b0c809ed4f0b.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/7105b31e230e6018f386b0c809ed4f0b.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/7105b31e230e6018f386b0c809ed4f0b.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN INFINITE WORLD</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide, climb, swim, ride, fly or run around an infinite procedurally generated world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/819285de5ddeec98b9db721bdfdf06d4.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/819285de5ddeec98b9db721bdfdf06d4.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/819285de5ddeec98b9db721bdfdf06d4.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALL PLAYERS, ONE SERVER</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With everyone in one server, you can play with your friends, and make new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/5495aef0a6212931817e907f740b494d.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/5495aef0a6212931817e907f740b494d.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/5495aef0a6212931817e907f740b494d.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEXT-TO-3D OBJECT CREATION</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring any idea to life by just typing it into our  DreamForge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/4627149bc86ef10083d72a5ff8646f59.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/4627149bc86ef10083d72a5ff8646f59.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/4627149bc86ef10083d72a5ff8646f59.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questions? Join our Discord by clicking the link on the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Please note, this is currently an Alpha Version of DreamWorld. We will continue to update and improve the game over time.**</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to DreamWorld, a groundbreaking Sandbox MMO, where all players create together in a single infinite world. Adventure through our biomes, collect rare resources, craft the best gear, and take down epic world bosses with friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE UNBELIEVABLE STRUCTURES</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy and paste building pieces. Create from any resource you collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/9cf54b7f23e6d8acdbd58a5b44f91312.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/9cf54b7f23e6d8acdbd58a5b44f91312.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/9cf54b7f23e6d8acdbd58a5b44f91312.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT TO SURVIVE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an array of weapons and spells to fight world bosses and mobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/7105b31e230e6018f386b0c809ed4f0b.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/7105b31e230e6018f386b0c809ed4f0b.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/7105b31e230e6018f386b0c809ed4f0b.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN INFINITE WORLD</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide, climb, swim, ride, fly or run around an infinite procedurally generated world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/819285de5ddeec98b9db721bdfdf06d4.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/819285de5ddeec98b9db721bdfdf06d4.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/819285de5ddeec98b9db721bdfdf06d4.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALL PLAYERS, ONE SERVER</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With everyone in one server, you can play with your friends, and make new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/5495aef0a6212931817e907f740b494d.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/5495aef0a6212931817e907f740b494d.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/5495aef0a6212931817e907f740b494d.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEXT-TO-3D OBJECT CREATION</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring any idea to life by just typing it into our  DreamForge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/4627149bc86ef10083d72a5ff8646f59.poster.avif?t=1752545531\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/4627149bc86ef10083d72a5ff8646f59.webm?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103280/extras/4627149bc86ef10083d72a5ff8646f59.mp4?t=1752545531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questions? Join our Discord by clicking the link on the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Please note, this is currently an Alpha Version of DreamWorld. We will continue to update and improve the game over time.**</p>",
    "short_description": "Build incredible structures with powerful tools. Explore the world with all players on one server. Battle bosses, farm, craft, and socialize with friends. How will you shape DreamWorld?",
